---
import AppDocLayout from '../../layouts/AppDocLayout.astro';
---

<AppDocLayout
  title="Clacky - Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Clacky - Self-Tape Partner, the iOS app. No data collected; your sides, takes and notes stay on your iPhone."
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/clacky/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mb-12">Clacky - Self-Tape Partner &middot; Effective October 26, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
            <p>Clacky does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. There&rsquo;s no account, no analytics, no ads and no tracking. Your sides, takes and notes are made and kept on your iPhone, and Clacky never sends them to us or anyone else.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Data Storage</h2>
            <p>Your scenes (the sides, characters and voices you chose), your takes, Clacky&rsquo;s notes, your tape log and your slate card are stored locally on your iPhone. The next deadline is shared with Clacky&rsquo;s own widgets through an App Group on the same device, and with your paired Apple Watch for the remote and complication. No data is sent to any server, cloud service, or third party.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Camera, Microphone and Speech</h2>
            <p>Clacky asks for each one separately, only to record your takes, read sides from a page, hear when your line ends, and check your lines after a take. You can say no to any of them, or change your mind in the iPhone Settings app, and the rest of the app keeps working.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">How the Smart Parts Work</h2>
            <p>Reading text from photos and PDFs uses Apple&rsquo;s on-device text recognition. The reader uses your iPhone&rsquo;s built-in voices. The line check uses on-device speech recognition; iOS may download its speech model from Apple the first time. Clacky&rsquo;s written notes and scene prep use Apple Intelligence on your iPhone. None of these steps send your content to Idle Fusion.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Sharing Your Tapes</h2>
            <p>When you export, the file goes only where you send it: Files, Photos, AirDrop, Mail or another app. What happens after that is up to you and that service.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Notifications</h2>
            <p>Deadline reminders and follow-up nudges are scheduled on your device. Nothing is sent through our servers.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Analytics &amp; Tracking</h2>
            <p>Clacky contains no analytics frameworks, no ad SDKs, no tracking pixels, and no telemetry of any kind. We do not use any third-party services that collect data.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Tips</h2>
            <p>Tips are handled entirely by Apple through the App Store; Clacky never sees your payment details or Apple Account. It only remembers on your device that you&rsquo;ve tipped, so it can stop asking.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Your Choices</h2>
            <p>You can delete a take, a scene, or everything at once from Settings &rarr; Your data. Deleting the app removes all of its data from your device.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Clacky does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>If this policy changes, we will update this page with the new effective date. Questions? Email <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppDocLayout>
